language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

contract LabContract.
interface LabInterface.
message-set LabRequests.
message-set LabResponses.

LabInterface follows LabContract.
LabContract allows LabRequests.
LabContract specifies "Request-correlated scoped admin, session-qualified cursors, bounded artifacts and server-configured replay targets; requester-specific results.".
LabContract status inherited.
LabContract allows LabResponses.
LabContract schema "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/contracts/proto/mvp1/lab/v1/lab.proto".
LabRequests member "mvp1.lab.v1.LabClientMessage".
LabResponses member "mvp1.lab.v1.LabServerMessage".
